[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17340.47, "timestamp": "04:49:00", "text": "姓名。你知道吗，这太尴尬了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17344.06, "timestamp": "04:49:04", "text": "我也想加上自己的名字，但我确实这么做了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17351.35, "timestamp": "04:49:11", "text": "那。就像电子表格那样，我从来没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17354.47, "timestamp": "04:49:14", "text": "我自己也加了进去。但在此之前，我感觉"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17356.91, "timestamp": "04:49:16", "text": "就像我必须……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17359.628, "timestamp": "04:49:19", "text": "添加。应该"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17363.11, "timestamp": "04:49:23", "text": "我说出他的名字？乔克。说出数字。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17366.11, "timestamp": "04:49:26", "text": "好吧，行。乔克。下一个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17369.59, "timestamp": "04:49:29", "text": "嗯。呃。等等，我忘了数字。等待。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17371.75, "timestamp": "04:49:31", "text": "我的Xbox账号是什么来着？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17374.35, "timestamp": "04:49:34", "text": "等待。呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17376.23, "timestamp": "04:49:36", "text": "等待。等等，等等，等等，等等，等等，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17380.47, "timestamp": "04:49:40", "text": "等等，等等。呃，Jocknix 4739。不，不，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17385.35, "timestamp": "04:49:45", "text": "等待。等待。我忘了。那是什么？ 4679."}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17392.27, "timestamp": "04:49:52", "text": "4679. 呃，他们还是没修好我的"}]